cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Tiered federated learning for ECG classification
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Shallal
    given-names: Osama
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/osamax2009/tiered-fl-ecg
abstract: >-
  Federated learning across device tiers that differ in sensing capability, using
  echo state networks with validation-gated aggregation and per-tier personalised
  readouts, evaluated on the PhysioNet/CinC Challenge 2021 ECG data.
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - reservoir computing
  - electrocardiography
  - edge computing
